'''GirlsMons''' (ガルズモンズ, ''Garuzu Monzu'') was a Japanese-exclusive puzzle-based combat game developed by PONOS. It was released for Android on September 25th, 2016 and for iOS on October 7th, 2016. The game shut down its services on January 19th, 2017.

As a token of appreciation for the players that played the game, [[Undead Cat (Special Cat)|Undead Cat]] (死にたてにゃんこ, ''Shinitate nyanko'') was added to [[Nyanko Daisensou]] as a Special Cat. It became available to all players during the 2022 [[The Forbidden Bride (Monthly Event)|The Forbidden Bride]] monthly event by rolling in the [[June Bride of the Devil (Event Gacha)|June Bride of the Devil]] event gacha. Originally, exclusively for the Japanese Version, it could be unlocked by accessing [https://ponos.s3.amazonaws.com/information/appli/battlecats/news/girlsmons_charaget.html this URL]. The URL has been available in the help menu (in the '''豆知識''' tab) found in the title screen from [[Version 5.7 Update|Version 5.7.0]] onwards.

In [[Version 6.0 Update|Version 6.0]] of Nyanko Daisensou, the Uber Rare Set [[Girls & Monsters: Angels of Terror (Gacha Event)|Girls & Monsters: Angels of Terror]] was created to commemorate the game.

